This directory is intended for private project libraries.

Place the Waveshare ESP32-AMOLED QSPI display driver here
once downloaded from: https://github.com/waveshareteam/ESP32-AMOLED-LCD

Each library must be in its own subdirectory, e.g.:
  lib/
  └── WaveshareAMOLED/
      ├── library.properties
      ├── src/
      │   ├── WaveshareAMOLED.h
      │   └── WaveshareAMOLED.cpp
      └── examples/

See: https://docs.platformio.org/page/projectconf/section_env_lib.html
